          <h3>No crypto agility awareness</h3>
          <p>
            Traditional federation models rarely prioritize paths based on cryptographic posture. As
            hybrid and post-quantum transitions emerge, the inability to reason about algorithm
            agility limits long-term trust resilience.
          </p>
